Don't use exceptions to test for the presence of an attribute.

Exceptions should be exceptional: don't rely on exceptions for control flow
for cases which are not actually errors.  Beyond style issues, this makes
it difficult to use 'catch throw' in the debugger to find where an
exception that's crashing a job is coming from.
